WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:06.116
"Go ahead, Ezra. Tell us your idea," Glen said.

2
00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.709
"What if we added extra weight to the other teams' canoes?" Ezra said.

3
00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:14.308
"That would slow them down."

4
00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:17.496
"But how can we do that?" Ivy asked.

5
00:00:17.497 --> 00:00:21.957
"There's no place to hide anything heavy in a canoe."

6
00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:26.067
"There's a rope tied to the front of each canoe," Ezra said.

7
00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:32.291
"What if we tied a rock to the other teams' canoes with that rope?"

8
00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:36.374
"That's an incredible idea!" Glen said.

9
00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:40.716
Ivy chuckled. "Not bad, Ezra.

10
00:00:40.717 --> 00:00:44.499
Especially from someone who doesn't want to cheat."

11
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.718
Ezra frowned. "I wish we didn't have to cheat.

12
00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:55.416
But we're terrible at canoeing. Cheating is our only hope."

13
00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:59.439
They headed toward the lake.

14
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:03.666
"Let's look for some heavy rocks," Glen said.

15
00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:08.541
They walked through the woods until they found two large rocks.

16
00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:12.680
Glen carried one and Ezra picked up the other.

17
00:01:12.681 --> 00:01:15.499
The rocks were very heavy.

18
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.541
After a few minutes, Glen dropped his rock.

19
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:23.058
"It's a long way to the lake with these heavy rocks.

20
00:01:23.059 --> 00:01:26.207
Why don't you take a turn, Ivy."

21
00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:30.147
"I just got out of the infirmary, remember?" Ivy snapped.

22
00:01:30.148 --> 00:01:36.207
"Do you want me to faint again?" She walked ahead of them.

23
00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:39.590
"You weren't really sick!" Glen yelled.

24
00:01:39.591 --> 00:01:42.416
"Get back here and help me!"

25
00:01:42.417 --> 00:01:44.760
Ivy looked over her shoulder.

26
00:01:44.761 --> 00:01:49.946
"Why don't you roll the rocks instead of carrying them?"

27
00:01:49.947 --> 00:01:54.030
"You think you're so smart!" Glen shot back.

28
00:01:54.031 --> 00:01:59.999
Then he looked at his rock and rolled it forward. "Okay, it sort of works."

29
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.464
Ezra and Glen rolled the rocks through the grass until they reached the lake.

30
00:02:05.465 --> 00:02:08.590
There were lots of campers swimming and canoeing.

31
00:02:08.591 --> 00:02:12.589
Larry and Penelope were the counselors on duty again.

32
00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:16.922
The friends rolled the rocks under a tree. Ezra

33
00:02:16.923 --> 00:02:20.084
wiped sweat from his forehead. "Maybe

34
00:02:20.085 --> 00:02:24.352
my idea wasn't so great. How

35
00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:29.499
can we tie the rocks to the canoes with all these people around?" Glen

36
00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:34.542
looked at the row of empty canoes tied to the dock and smiled. "Leave

37
00:02:34.543 --> 00:02:37.707
that part to me." Ivy

38
00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:44.045
groaned. "Do we have to?" ***

39
00:02:44.046 --> 00:02:48.908
Early the next morning, the three friends followed Glen's plan.

40
00:02:48.909 --> 00:02:53.026
They sneaked down to the lake before morning assembly.

41
00:02:53.027 --> 00:02:58.047
Then they rolled the two rocks out to the dock and dropped them into the water.

42
00:02:58.048 --> 00:03:04.749
Ezra looked nervous. "We have to hurry back to assembly before Private catches us."

43
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:12.249
"Right," Glen said. "Then, as soon as it's over, we'll come back to finish the job."

44
00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.612
"I hope this works," Ivy said.

45
00:03:15.613 --> 00:03:23.582
Glen's plan didn't seem very smart to her. But she couldn't think of anything better.

46
00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:29.343
Later, after activities started, they were back at the lake in swimsuits.

47
00:03:29.344 --> 00:03:32.666
They walked out onto the dock.

48
00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:37.051
"Are you sure you can do this?" Ivy asked Glen.

49
00:03:37.052 --> 00:03:40.407
"The water is really deep."

50
00:03:40.408 --> 00:03:47.020
"Of course!" Glen said. "All I have to do is dive in and find our rocks.

51
00:03:47.021 --> 00:03:50.372
I'll pick one up and tie it to a canoe with the rope.

52
00:03:50.373 --> 00:03:58.791
Then I'll come up for air, dive down, and find the second one. Easy-peasy!"

53
00:03:58.792 --> 00:04:05.291
"Do you see our rocks down there?" Ezra asked.

54
00:04:05.292 --> 00:04:16.541
"No, but they're down there somewhere," Glen said. "Trust me. I got this."

55
00:04:16.542 --> 00:04:21.543
Glen dived off the dock and disappeared underwater.

56
00:04:21.544 --> 00:04:24.874
Ivy and Ezra watched and waited.

57
00:04:24.875 --> 00:04:31.343
"He's been underwater an awfully long time," Ezra said nervously.

58
00:04:31.344 --> 00:04:37.877
They kept watching the water, waiting for Glen to appear.

